1
00:00:00,581 --> 00:00:02,421
(Sheldon:)Are you two ever getting married?

2
00:00:02,583 --> 00:00:06,123
(Sheldon:)And, if so, where will we all live?
Have you thought about that?

3
00:00:07,654 --> 00:00:08,994
(Leonard:)-No.
-Penny?

4
00:00:09,156 --> 00:00:10,496
OK, wait. What are we doing?

5
00:00:10,657 --> 00:00:12,327
(Leonard:)For some reason,
we're planning a future

6
00:00:12,493 --> 00:00:14,633
(Leonard:)where we both live
with Sheldon forever.

7
00:00:14,795 --> 00:00:16,775
(Sheldon:)Good. Now we're getting somewhere.

8
00:00:18,398 --> 00:00:20,738
(Penny:)Look, I know you think I'm being
reckless, and you might be right,

9
00:00:20,901 --> 00:00:22,311
(Penny:)but I need to take this shot.

10
00:00:22,469 --> 00:00:26,509
(Sheldon:)No kidding. Despite what it says
on her resume, she is no longer 22.

11
00:00:30,644 --> 00:00:32,954
(Leonard:)I swear, I am on your side.

12
00:00:33,113 --> 00:00:35,993
(Penny:)You keep saying you're on my
side, but you don't act like it.

13
00:00:36,149 --> 00:00:38,529
(Sheldon:)He does that to me, too.
Why do we put up with it?

14
00:00:40,687 --> 00:00:43,927
(Leonard:)Listen, I could never do
what you're doing, okay?

15
00:00:44,091 --> 00:00:46,631
(Leonard:)-I would be terrified.
-Well, it's scary for me, too.

16
00:00:46,793 --> 00:00:48,633
(Sheldon:)I'm fine with it.

17
00:00:49,930 --> 00:00:54,040
(Leonard:)My point is, just because I couldn't
do it doesn't mean you shouldn't.

18
00:00:54,201 --> 00:00:56,651
(Leonard:)And I'm proud of you.

19
00:00:58,605 --> 00:01:01,215
(Penny:)Okay. Thank you.

